message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and also
  cite the original NASA/JHU-APL report by T. Rice (2003) listed under
  references.
type: software
title: >-
  Three-Dimensional Nozzle Design Code: corrected transonic throat solution
  and standalone Windows builds (modified version of NASA LEW-20180)
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-10"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23269365
